{"id":"n349c73d361","headline":"Palm oil stocks set to surge as Indonesia said to be scaling back export overhaul: analysts","summary":"Analysts say Indonesia is scaling back its export overhaul, and brokerages including UOBKH and RHB are moving to upgrade battered plantation stocks. The report was published by The Business Times.","why":"Indonesia and Malaysia are the world's largest palm oil producers, so export rules there shape global vegetable oil supply and prices. Plantation companies are sensitive to these policies.","category":"commodities","event_type":"trade","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Jakarta","country":"Indonesia","lat":-6.209,"lon":106.846,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Business Times","url":"https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/companies-markets/palm-oil-stocks-set-surge-indonesia-said-be-scaling-back-export-overhaul-analysts"},"sources":[{"name":"The Business Times","url":"https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/companies-markets/palm-oil-stocks-set-surge-indonesia-said-be-scaling-back-export-overhaul-analysts"}],"published_at":"2026-06-18T01:44:34Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"d684b9885424d95d","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-06-18T01:44:34Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-06-18T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"ID","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/palm-oil-plantation-1464654.jpg","alt":"palm oil plantation (illustration)","credit":"tristantan","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/palm-oil-fruit-background-ripe-1464654/"}}